{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"Navars soul did not quite have the rest he had hoped to achieve. In death he was unable to depart the abyss and was consumed by the croatoan. Even hearing firsthand the battle of his lady against the hunger. When she was consumed his heart broke for a moment, but quickly felt a warmth. \"Rest, i can feel you are not the little giantkin I whispered to in the woods. I gave my soul so that bahamut could be preserved, and eventually healed. Hope is not lost, and while I may be imprisoned here, i carry on in the hearts of those that followed. It's alright, simply rest my faithful little navar. And once I return, your spirit will nourish the lands as you always loved to in life.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T17:26:35.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739897016787796110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
