{"attachments":[{"content_type":null,"filename":"Screenshot_20200805-123151.jpg","id":"740426960508944424","local_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/attachments/736679166262509618/740426960508944424-Screenshot_20200805-123151.jpg","message_id":"740426960634642512","sha256":"a8d1afa7491baa4292699c9ad8e6f6e8646412e7c945add05bf819ee27e0a2e1","size":26284,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/736679166262509618/740426960508944424/Screenshot_20200805-123151.jpg?ex=6abfdc97&is=6abe8b17&hm=38a47a4dc6e7aa5fd5d1b5042eb95075d83c1c9940c42cd27e471416ef25596c&"}],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"The catatonia is mostly just for flavor but it also has been in my character sheet since day one anyway.","created_at":"2020-08-05T04:32:23.883000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-05T04:33:53.925000Z","id":"740426960634642512","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"Cato remembers.\nHe is running around rooftops. Hunting his prey. He can see them waiting under the tree. Lazy, off guard. Cato pounces on the pray.\n\"Cato! Why did you do that\"-Elith\n\"You lose. Stay on guard.\"-Cato\n\"I was sleeping.\"-Elith\n\"Keep at least one of you awake\" Cato says gesturing to the bullette \n\"Hydraxon does his best for me.\"Elith pets the bullette lovingly\n\"On guard always.\"\nThe scene flashes in his mind\nElith's head on a pike\nAnother flash\nThe two of them laying under the moonlight\n\"What do you think it means Cato?\"\n\"Eternity.\"\n\"We have all the time in the world. You and I forever.\"-Cato\n\"We all die eventually Cato\"-Elith\n\"Not you. I will protect you forever.\"-Cato\nCato kisses the small elf boy. Happy. Content. Peaceful.\n\"I love you Elith.\"\n\"I love you too Cato.\"\nThe scene pauses in Cato's mind\nHe is watching the two boy's sitting in peace, separate from them.\nA glowing figure appears next to him\nA warm light bathes Cato in warmth\n\"Do not fear Cato. Eternity is still out there for us.\"\nCato looks over and see's not a boy, but a man. Strong body, and caring voice.\n\"Elith.\"\n\"It wasn't your fault Cato. I was off guard.\"\nCato nods\n\"I blamed myself for so long.\"-Cato\n\"I know, I would have done the same, but no more. You must live your life. I will be here waiting at the other side.\"-Elith\nCato nods again\n\"I love you Cato.\"\n\"I love you too Elith.\"\nThey kiss again. Under the moon once more.\n\"I will see you soon Cato.\"\nCato nods. \"Hopefully not too soon.\" He thinks of Wren, Wynne, ♪, Leaf, Web, Baeshra, and Skitter.\nElith disappears as quickly as he came\nTime passes slowly\nIt flashes again","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:00:45.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740464298186244146","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"A women is speaking. Their voice is soft. Using the same tone as Surya does for ♪\n\"I am sorry Cato. I will love you for Eternity.\"\nCato walks around the women. She sets a small bundle on the ground. She kisses the bundle one the forehead.\nCato gets a look at her face\nA panther Tabaxi. Scar over her left eye. Tears streaming down her face.\nCato wakes with a shock.\nHe remembered everything\n(End scene)","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:00:46.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740464302875475998","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
